s=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167300/extras/af7cea95c8f35946e135ffbdc6efceac.avif?t=1761748194\" width=612 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Combat with a Modern Touch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack in eight directions with a mix of melee strikes and ranged projectiles. Collect gold, find powerful scrolls and potions, and visit the mysterious merchant \u00c6lfwyn to upgrade your gear between battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167300/extras/3b1cff24934fd861fbc3eec91d48e95e.poster.avif?t=1761748194\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167300/extras/3b1cff24934fd861fbc3eec91d48e95e.webm?t=1761748194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167300/extras/3b1cff24934fd861fbc3eec91d48e95e.mp4?t=1761748194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where you come in, brave champion\u2026help us save the kingdom of Mercia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167300/extras/bc030080df7a1c2da01cc3b4c0f8787e.poster.avif?t=1761748194\" width=612 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167300/extras/bc030080df7a1c2da01cc3b4c0f8787e.webm?t=1761748194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167300/extras/bc030080df7a1c2da01cc3b4c0f8787e.mp4?t=1761748194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced hack and slash gameplay with a retro arcade feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player and local co-op for heroic team play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous handcrafted pixel art across four unique regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack by legendary composer Manami Matsumae</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights and satisfying enemy waves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bitmap Bureau"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167300/header.jpg?t=1761748194","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92021 Bitmap Bureau, Licensed to and published by Numskull Games Ltd","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 and Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+, Vulkan capable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any compatible soundcard<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 2 player requires at least one controller</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></